mcp__leansearch__lean_search: Search local workspace/configured Lean declarations offline; for broad Mathlib search also try LeanSearch/Loogle/Moogle/LSP tools. Use mode='text' for natural language, 'name' for a declaration name, or 'type' for a signature pattern where ?a/?b/_ are wildcards. Returns name, kind, library, signature, and file:line for each hit.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__leansearch__lean_search(args: {
  // Restrict to one library/project name.
  lib?: string;
  limit?: number;
  mode?: "text" | "name" | "type";
  // Query text, name, or type pattern.
  query: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

